// EGG UI Brand Logos. Figma: Brand page (64:2), the components `Logo / <Name>` (12 fictional customer
// marks: a symbol and a wordmark) and `Logo / Press / <Name>` (6 fictional press mastheads, wordmark
// only). Exported from Figma as SVG and kept as path data: one color (foreground/default in Figma),
// drawn here in currentColor so every mark follows the theme and the text color around it. 32 high,
// width from the Figma component (aspect ratio kept). Dim a whole row with opacity (Logo Tile plain),
// never recolor one logo. These are sample brands made for the library: replace them with real
// customer logos (with permission) before launch, and show press marks only for real coverage.
// Accessibility: with `title` the mark is an image with that name; without it, it is decorative
// (aria-hidden), for when the name is already in text next to it.
